@startuml infraestrutura-firebase
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
title Infraestrutura de persistência — Frontend × Firebase × Backend

rectangle "Dispositivo (Capacitor / Web)" as Device #FFFDE7 {
  component "React App\n(AuthContext +\nanalysisService)" as App
}

cloud "Firebase" as FB #E3F2FD {
  component "Firebase Auth" as FA
  database "Cloud Firestore" as FS
}

rectangle "Servidor" as Server #E8F5E9 {
  component "API Robyn\n+ Firebase Admin SDK" as API
  component "Modelo TensorFlow\nv2.0-y-bilateral" as Model
}

App --> FA : login / register / logout\n(SDK client)
App --> API : REST\n(header x-access-token)
API --> FA : valida identidade\n(quando aplicável via uid do body)
API --> FS : CRUD users +\npredictions
API --> Model : inferência /\nGrad-CAM

note bottom of App
  O frontend NÃO acessa Firestore
  diretamente. Toda leitura/escrita
  de análises passa pela API.
end note

note right of FA
  Web: getAuth / signInWithPopup
  Native: initializeAuth +\nCapacitor Google Auth
end note

@enduml
